<title>CHINA: Fong's Ind year net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Fong's Ind year net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.8 gain    vs  8.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  10.33 loss  vs  5.04 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    7.90 profit vs  32.42 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     479.58	vs  671.42</p>
<p>    Company name		 Fong's Industries Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 11-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 26</p>
<p>NOTE - Fong's Industries makes dyeing and drying machines.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$7.8 million on disposal of invetment properties and loss of HK$2.53 million on redundancy payments.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is one H.K. cent vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
